{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b630f300ee41b021","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9013-E003\n3\ttitle: FIPS 140-3 compliance evidence package and certification submission\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9013\n5\tcomponent: KServe\n6\tteam: RHOAI Serving\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9013-E001\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9013-E002\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 0\n14\t  pattern_precedent: -1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n16\t  existing_foundation: -1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: -1\n19\t  human_process_gates: -1\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: Low\n25\tai_implementability_score: -1\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# FIPS 140-3 compliance evidence package and certification submission\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tAssembles the FIPS 140-3 compliance evidence package for the model serving\n36\tstack — module inventory, build attestations, and test results for every\n37\tserving-stack image — and shepherds it through the mandatory security review\n38\tboard sign-off milestones to submission at the external accredited\n39\tcertification laboratory.\n40\t\n41\t## Scope\n42\t\n43\t- Establish the evidence package structure required by the security review\n44\t  board and the certification process\n45\t- Collect the per-image module inventories, build attestations, and\n46\t  FIPS-enabled-cluster test results produced by the serving-stack FIPS\n47\t  remediation work\n48\t- Assemble the complete evidence package and drive it through each security\n49\t  review board sign-off milestone defined for the certification process\n50\t- Submit the completed evidence package to the external accredited\n51\t  certification laboratory and confirm it is triaged\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- The evidence package contains the module inventory, build attestations, and\n56\t  FIPS-enabled-cluster test results for every serving-stack image\n57\t- The evidence package has passed each security review board sign-off\n58\t  milestone defined for the certification process\n59\t- The evidence package has been submitted to the external accredited\n60\t  certification laboratory and its triage is confirmed\n61\t\n62\t## Risks / Notes\n63\t\n64\t- Certification-lab turnaround is historically six to nine months, and\n65\t  review-board cadence is fixed by that board. Both are externally controlled\n66\t  and cannot be compressed by engineering effort; they are schedule risks on\n67\t  this epic, not conditions its deliverable produces. The acceptance criteria\n68\t  therefore stop at the engineering completion point the team controls —\n69\t  package assembled, board milestones passed, submission made and triaged.\n70\t  The certification outcome itself is outside this strategy's requirements.\n71\t\n72\t## HLR Traceability\n73\t\n74\t- HLR-2 (P0): compliance evidence package (module inventory, build\n75\t  attestations, test results) assembled and submitted through the security\n76\t  review board to the external certification lab.\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bd67c6792646fe32","agent_id":"af11b6b29ee4af485","session_id":"1394d656-32ae-4405-935b-3f7c1b336014","uuid":"aa55d5a7-69e9-4cd6-8ee2-8c3f1b5de58f","timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:19:01.122Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b630f300ee41b021","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
